            },
            "reviewBody": "I put about 1 cup lemon juice (squeezed myself) and 1 cup sugar and filled container (with sugar &amp; juice already in it) TO two quarts... (So 2 qt. total) and it was nice.. Chilling now; I think the whole heating water may've been just to ensure the sugar and water mixed well... Me, I just stirred it for a while.\n:-)\nLike someone else said, (and I agree, even with minor adjustments I made) \"not too tart not too sweet\"... and once chilled, I'm sure it'll be \"on point\"..",
