            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Margie"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Perfect! I was craving a glass of lemonade and this hit the spot! I just dissolved the sugar in one cup of hot tap water, added the lemon juice and a little less than three cups more water. Put on the lid to the jug I was making it in, shook and pored over crushed ice. Yummy! Sweet and tangy enough for my taste.",
